    skos:altLabel 'Sparton T-5 XBT'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Sparton of Canada T-5 XBT probe'@en ;
    skos:definition 'An expendable free-fall temperature probe that provides a profile of measured temperature against depth calculated from a fall-rate model. The T-5 XBT Probe can be used within a maximum depth of 1830m, may be deployed at a ship speed of up to 6 knots and has a vertical resolution of 65cm.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL1384'^^xsd:string .
